//
// Host-only: `--gs` must reach the GEMM micro-kernel, not only the host
// packer. Compiles nothing: the kernel builders are replaced with recorders,
// so what is asserted is the flags the driver WOULD have passed to Peano.
// Rationale and history are in the test's own docstring.
//
// RUN: %PYTHON %S/test_prefill_gs_reaches_kernel.py | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: PASS  test_the_recorder_sees_a_real_compile
// CHECK: PASS  test_gs_reaches_the_gemm_kernel
// CHECK: PASS  test_a_stale_gemm_object_is_not_reused_across_group_sizes
// CHECK: PASS  test_the_cache_object_name_carries_every_build_affecting_flag
// CHECK: PASS  test_a_stale_ELF_is_refused_at_a_different_group_size
// CHECK: PASS  test_run_only_validates_the_cached_group_size_too
// CHECK: PASS  test_the_audit_can_actually_fail
// CHECK: PASS  test_disagreeing_channels_are_refused
// CHECK: prefill gs-reaches-kernel tests: 8/8 passed
